The Meowscarade is a social institution, not a Species requirement. A cat may betray it without becoming biologically less catlike or losing Species Unlocks. The widespread Vow above represents cats who personally internalize that obligation.

The native feline religious tradition is Autotheism, but religion is not part of Species qualification. A Perfectly Normal Cat may adopt another religion; native cat society simply rejects the premise that a deity's power or divinity creates an obligation to obey it.
